[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489624912","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405#issuecomment-3489624912","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3489624912,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P_3NQ","user":{"login":"TranquilMarmot","id":504259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDI1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/504259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot","html_url":"https://github.com/TranquilMarmot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TranquilMarmot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T06:45:28Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T06:45:58Z","body":"This is documented in the upgrade guide from 4.4 -> 4.5\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.5.html#d-model-import\n\nFor me, everything was working in 4.5 but when I opened my project in 4.6 all my skeleton'd meshes were not having bone weights applied to them (they were first imported in Godot 4.1)... I had to go and change the gLTF naming version to \"Godot 4.5 or later\" for all of them and reimport to get them to work again.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489624912/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489987940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405#issuecomment-3489987940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3489987940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QBP1k","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T08:50:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:50:38Z","body":"Yeah, that's what happened to me.  I had to reimport everything because animations weren't working and then I noticed this bug, meaning the switch to 4.6 will likely break a bunch of stuff that technically would have broken in 4.5 had the files been reimported.\n\nI'm not really sure what the best solution is here.  It's unfortunate that the import setting wasn't introduced earlier when the naming behavior changed.  Right now the importer is going to have to make some assumptions.  It either needs to assume .import files without gltf/naming_version are 4.0-4.1 or 4.2-4.4.  I feel like most people are probably using 4.2-4.4 by now, so defaulting to that would probably result in the fewest things breaking.  Perhaps there's another entry in the .import file that can be keyed off of to determine the version it should use.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3489987940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490203553","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405#issuecomment-3490203553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3490203553,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QCEeh","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T09:46:11Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T09:46:11Z","body":"CC @godotengine/import","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490203553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491995966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405#issuecomment-3491995966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3491995966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QI6E-","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T15:48:36Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T15:51:58Z","body":"> @jitspoe: It either needs to assume .import files without gltf/naming_version are 4.0-4.1\n\nThat is already the behavior, as introduced in PR #84271. Are you saying that this isn't the case? Your OP indicates it is working as intended:\n\n> Edit: This seems to be due to the the fact that .import files do not contain \"gltf/naming_version\", so it defaults to 0, which is the 4.0 naming\n\nOh, I see, this is because you're using `.blend` files. PR #84271 was only for glTF, PR #107352 introduced this for `.blend` files, in which case we have no way to distinguish between 4.0-4.1 and 4.2-4.4, so it assumes the naming version 0 for 4.0-4.1. There isn't really any perfect solution here, users will need to explicitly choose the naming version they want.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3491995966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493728232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405#issuecomment-3493728232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3493728232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QPg_o","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T22:04:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T22:04:34Z","body":"Yeah, I imagine defaulting to 1 will probably cause fewer issues.  4.0-4.1 were kind of rough so I imagine most people have already updated prior to updating to 4.6.  I don't suppose there was an import parameter added in 4.2 that could be checked?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493728232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716011785","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112405#issuecomment-3716011785","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112405","id":3716011785,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dfdcJ","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T19:27:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T19:27:17Z","body":"We have to be careful that we can upgrade the blender version again in our importer. I suspect the code in PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107352 only hard codes those versions-naming version combos.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"